    "description": "The Streaming Subscription Upgrade API facilitates the upgrade of existing streaming subscriptions to enhance service capabilities. This operation is essential for users looking to access new features or improve their existing subscription plan. Common consumers include developers and system integrators who manage streaming service subscriptions on behalf of end-users. The API allows for seamless transitions between subscription tiers, ensuring optimal user experiences without service interruptions.",
